PART 1: SOURCE CODE, SDKs, OPEN SYNTH ENGINES & MODULES (MIT LICENSE)
================================================================================

All source code, headers, SDKs, open-source synthesizer engines, DSP modules,
drivers, utilities, and documentation in this repository — including:
  - `.ptfx` Sample Editor Plugin SDK (`editor-fx-sdk/`)
  - Open Synth SDK headers (`synth/include/PolySynth/` and `synth/include/PolySynth/sdk/`)
  - Open-source C++ synthesizer engines (`core/synth/engines/`, including `CHIP`)
  - Hardware abstraction layers, drivers, audio libraries, and utilities (`platforms/`, `util/`, `core/libs/`)
  - Individual classes, DSP algorithms, UI widgets, and source modules in `core/`

are licensed under the standard MIT License below, subject only to the
Wholesale Commercial Clone Restriction in Part 2 with respect to the complete
integrated Polyend Tracker application/firmware as a whole, and Part 3 with
respect to the precompiled binary archives in `synth/lib/`.

